# The portal's install and build output (P1.4). `npm ci` writes node_modules/
# and `vite build` writes dist/, and neither is a fact about the source: the
# lockfile is what an install reproduces from, and dist/ is an artefact a
# machine rebuilds. Committing either would put hundreds of megabytes of
# somebody else's code under ee/, which is exactly what the licence audit
# reads the lockfile instead of.
node_modules/
dist/
